id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-11-16T04:06:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T09:55:02Z","closed_at":"2026-01-07T22:16:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112838","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112838.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112838.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #106904 (error -50) and #35445 (error -10863)\r\n\r\nThe CoreAudio driver was passing nullptr as the buffer to AudioUnitRender on macOS, which requires a pre-allocated buffer. Additionally, it was using the hardware sample rate for input while the output used a different rate, causing sample rate mismatches.\r\n\r\nThis restores the working behavior from Godot 3.6 by:\r\n- Pre-allocating input_buf in init_input_device()\r\n- Using the allocated buffer in input_callback instead of nullptr\r\n- Forcing input sample rate to match output sample rate on macOS\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit: Fixes #35445*","closed_by":{"login":"graphific","id":10637696,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjM3Njk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10637696?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific","html_url":"https://github.com/graphific","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/grap